config BR2_PACKAGE_AR9311_RADIO
	bool "AR9311 SDIO radio"
	depends on BR2_FPVOS_SOC_AR9311
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
	depends on BR2_HOSTARCH = "x86_64"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_AR9311_MMC
	select BR2_PACKAGE_AR_LIBRE
	select BR2_PACKAGE_OPEN8030
	help
	  AR8030 radio over the AR9311 SDIO host, using ar_libre and
	  Open8030. Select the board's Open8030 profile and radio
	  config, SDIO transport and ground/station role. Device tree
	  supplies the host wiring, power rails and reset GPIO.
	  Firmware loads into radio RAM; no flash writes.
